        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVCHM, Fifth Avenue Plate With Eden Prairie Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClassically styled, the simplicity of the Fifth Avenue Plate With Eden Prairie Knob will enhance the beauty of your home no matter if your home is styled contemporarily or traditionally. The Egg Shaped Eden Prairie Door Knob is both elegant and timeless. Glorified by over a century of history, the Fifth Avenue style is found in many of America's finest homes, offices and public buildings. Marked by a clean, crisp look, its unpretentious, tailored style reinforces an expression of self-assurance. The classic style of the Fifth Avenue Series draws attention to the stoutness created by its designers. It has a 10 year finish warranty and a lifetime mechanical warranty as well. It will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-fifth-avenue-series\"><b>Fifth Avenue Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur FAVCHM Fifth Avenue Plate With Eden Prairie Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fifth Avenue Plate With Eden Prairie Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Plate Height: 7.17\"</li>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Plate Width: 2.44\"</li>\r\n<li>Eden Prairie Knob Height: 2.68\"</li>\r\n<li>Eden Prairie Knob Width: 1.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Eden Prairie Knob Projection: 2.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-FAVEDN-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262180\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur FAVEDN Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Fifth Avenue Plate With Eden Prairie Knob, Grandeur FAVEND",
                "description": "Grandeur FAVCHM, Fifth Avenue Plate With Eden Prairie Knob - Classically styled, the simplicity of the Fifth Avenue Plate With Eden Prairie Knob will enhance the beauty of your home no matter if your home is styled contemporarily or traditionally. The Egg Shaped Eden Prairie Door Knob is both elegant and timeless. Glorified by over a century of history, the Fifth Avenue style is found in many of America's finest homes, offices and public buildings. Marked by a clean, crisp look, its unpretentious, tailored style reinforces an expression of self-assurance. The classic style of the Fifth Avenue Series draws attention to the stoutness created by its designers. It has a 10 year finish warranty and a lifetime mechanical warranty as well. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
                "keywords": "Fifth Avenue Plate With Eden Prairie Knobs, Fifth Avenue Eden Prairie Knobs, GRA-FAVEND, Grandeur FAVEND, egg knobsets, Eden Prairie Knob with Fifth Avenue rosettes, classic knobs, egg knobs, Grandeur fifth avenue series,"
